--- !u!114 &8451665796814051332
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7241917303112684930}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2e97b4b615f64ee79df640ac8f8237fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: {fileID: 8010857315048023027}
  tips:
  - Sometimes greed is all you need! Attack the mountains of gold to get even more!
  - Black Towers are neutral. They DO NOT WANT TO PARTICIPATE in our war. And that
    will be their downfall.
  - "Sometimes it's worth dealing with the enemy directly \u2014 try giving them
    a flick on the forehead."
  - If you strike a deal with the treasurer, you can hire a couple of squads for
    almost nothing.
  - Sometimes the warriors on the road from one castle to another can double in number.
    Not sure how that happens.
  - Not everyone living in a conquered castle wants to have anything to do with you.
